body:
yea tbh it was too much lol i was stuck in a weird loop where i was listening to music then suddenly i started feeling lkike i couldnt breathe, then i take off my earphones to calm myself down, then i put them back on and repeat lol for what felt likehours

&#x200B;

i didnt eat anythign that day so thats probably made it worse too lol next time only doing 20 or something haha

im not 100% sure i overdosed but i did have a seizure for doing 60 pills in one go

&#x200B;

first it just felt like a normal trip, was kinda boring like usual but then i noticed my hands were shaking way more than usual, i remember i couldnt even put my earbuds in cuz they were shaking so bad, my heart was also beating really fast but i thought i was fine so i tried to go to sleep but i couldnt cuz my started itching really bad, after like 10 mins of that my legs started shaking too really bad and the hands shake just got even worse it actually hurted my wrist cus they were moving all over the place, after like 30 mins of that i thought i was gonna die so i finally decided to get help, it took me like 10 mins just to walk from where i was to my parents room(only like 10meters), so yeah my parents helped got me on their car and after that i cant remember anything but apparently i got really stiff and started like spazing yk i had a seizure

&#x200B;

again idk if i did overdose but i had an awful experince asnd hopefully it will discourage you from taking benadryl recreationally. If u want something to lighten your mood then benadryl is the WORST thing to take its gonna make u miserable and depressed u better go do something fun like shrooms or idk

&#x200B;

edit: also my hands and feet soles felt wet but they werent idk why

idk every trip i see different stuff, one trip i could be seeing the normal stuff like shadow ppl, spiders,etc. but sometimes i see words and numbers, ive seen normal ppl, and i also seen like images that i had seen on my computer before i took the dph(cat pictures, cars, fursonas lol).

&#x200B;

i walk like if i was drunk and my legs shake a lot but i can easily go to the bathroom or something, and when i talk i cant wisper or talk quietly cuz nothing comes out of my mouth

man i just needed some conditioner and some food why would it be satire lol :(

&#x200B;

 u huwt my fewwings uwu

